 and anti-tank troops. The brigade saw action in several major operations during the war, including the Normandy landings in June 1944 and the Battle of Arnhem in September 1944. During the Normandy landings, the brigade was tasked with securing the eastern flank of the invasion area and capturing several key bridges. At Arnhem, the brigade was tasked with securing the landing zones and holding bridges over the Rhine River. The 6th Airlanding Brigade suffered heavy losses during both operations, with many of its troops killed, wounded, or captured. However, the brigade's actions were critical in the success of these operations. After the war, the 6th Airlanding Brigade was disbanded."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BrothersInArms","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Passive","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDealDamageAddDamage"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Combat","EHelpBubbleTypes::Fury"],"hasFury":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/Spring2023Candidates/t_airborne_arnhem.t_airborne_arnhem","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Simon Smith","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/6th_AIRLANDING_BRIGADE.6th_AIRLANDING_BRIGADE","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":365.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_6th_airlanding_brigade_photo","SourceString":"Soldiers of the 6th Airlanding Brigade admiring the graffiti on the side of their glider before their drop on the night of 6th June 1944.","LocalizedString":"Soldiers of the 6th Airlanding Brigade admiring the graffiti on the side of their glider before their drop on the night of 6th June 1944."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"","Key":"0DBC5F184A8F0CFAA1A9D6BB449E2AC6","SourceString":"Infan